r (Apr-Jun 2026) is the first reported under the new cycle. Total equity climbed to Rs 15.59bn (Group) from Rs 4.07bn a year earlier, and interest-bearing borrowings fell as proceeds were used for debt settlement. Despite the profit turnaround, operating cash flow was negative Rs 678mn (vs Rs -20.5mn a year ago), driven by a large increase in trade and other receivables. operating_profit is derived (profit_before_tax minus Net Finance Income/(Expenses)) since the company discloses only a combined net finance line.", "source_doc_id": "52083", "source_page": 1, "gaps_note": "operating_profit is a derived figure (PBT minus the disclosed combined net finance line), not a separately reported subtotal.", "takeaway": "Colombo Dockyard swung back to a Group profit (Rs 80.2mn PBT) this quarter, helped by a sharply lower cost base and the balance-sheet repair from the Mazagon Dock rights issue, even as revenue and operating cash flow stayed weak.", "qoq": [{"metric": "revenue", "label": "Revenue", "prior_period_label": "Quarter ended 31 March 2026", "prior_value": 7609595.0, "new_period_label": "Quarter ended 30 June 2026", "new_value": 5843353.0, "pct_change": -0.23210722778281892, "direction": "deteriorated", "prior_period_end_date": "2026-03-31", "new_period_end_date": "2026-06-30"}, {"metric": "gross_profit", "label": "Gross Profit", "prior_period_label": "Quarter ended 31 March 2026", "prior_value": 1022632.0, "new_period_label": "Quarter ended 30 June 2026", "new_value": 1211439.0, "pct_change": 0.18462848805826534, "direction": "improved", "prior_period_end_date": "2026-03-31", "new_period_end_date": "2026-06-30"}, {"metric": "operating_profit", "label": "Operating Profit", "prior_period_label": "Quarter ended 31 March 2026", "prior_value": -188397.0, "new_period_label": "Quarter ended 30 June 2026", "new_value": 268445.0, "pct_change": 2.4248899929404395, "direction": "improved", "prior_period_end_date": "2026-03-31", "new_period_end_date": "2026-06-30"}, {"metric": "